{"id":"2fe6d911cae6289e","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-woodin.md","title":"Woodin Cardinal","display":"thm-woodin — Woodin Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-woodin","aliases":["58-thm-woodin"],"display":"thm-woodin — Woodin Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-woodin]]","[[58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness]]","[[58-df-v-alpha]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-woodin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-woodin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-woodin — Woodin Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness\">58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"58-df-v-alpha\">58-df-v-alpha</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> (Woodin 基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq V_\\delta\">\\(A \\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span> (子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Woodin}\">\\(\\mathrm{Woodin}\\)</span> (Woodin-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (class-level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\delta\">\\(&lt;\\delta\\)</span>-strongness witness)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V_\\delta\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span>, some <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\delta\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\delta\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\delta\">\\(&lt;\\delta\\)</span>-strong for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; the target embedding may depend on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta&lt;\\delta\">\\(\\eta&lt;\\delta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Woodin cardinals are central to deriving models of determinacy.</li>\n<li>The class-level witness replaces the set-coded elementary-embedding predicate, which cannot accept the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as its domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-woodin","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-woodin]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness","status":"resolved","id":"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-v-alpha","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-v-alpha]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-woodin","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\delta$ (Woodin 基数, see [[58-df-woodin]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-woodin","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Woodin}$ (Woodin-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-woodin]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"A \\subseteq V_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Woodin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1146,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4494","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-woodin.md|58-thm-woodin]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["da3159c0c219916e","f9019f8b9c0a2aa1","aabdf30